SUMMARY:Wednesday Jazz On The Patio Danny Iannucci & Friends
DESCRIPTION:Danny Iannucci & Friends are back for a Spring & Summer series of delightful jazz\, delicious drink specials and your go-to mid-week wind down. Join us from 6-8p April-August to enjoy the fabulous jazz trio & 1/2 Off Wine\, $10 Specialty Martinis\, and $4 Select Craft Drafts. \nFree to attend and all ages are welcome. \n*Rain or Extreme temps will bring us indoors. \n  \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/wednesday-jazz-on-the-patio-danny-iannucci-friends/2026-06-24/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
